OL,3,AUS announces new tariffs on host of    
OL,4,Acountries including China              
OL,6,FChina is facing the highest rate of up 
OL,7,Fto 40%, followed by Vietnam at up to   
OL,8,F35% and then others facing either 20%  
OL,9,For 25%.                                
